{
  "name": "libudev-rs",
  "description": "A safe, idiomatic Rust wrapper around the native Linux libudev library for hardware device discovery and event monitoring. It leverages RAII patterns and Rust's ownership model to manage libudev contexts, device enumeration, and real-time kernel event sockets. The library facilitates querying sysfs attributes, device properties, and hierarchical relationships within the Linux device tree.",
